          <span class="bg-surface-subtle px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-stone-200/80 font-medium">4 Kamar (Lt. Atas)</span>
          <span class="bg-syariah-gold/20 text-primary-deep px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-syariah-gold/40 font-semibold">6 Kamar (Full House)</span>
