              Balkon Terbuka &amp; Asri
            </span>
            <span class="bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono text-[11px] border border-white/15 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px] text-amber-300">spa</span>
